    · rw [h];exact hist 1028 (by simp)
    · rw [h];exact hist 1 (by simp)
    · rw [h];exact hist 1032 (by simp)
  intro q used
  rcases Finset.mem_union.mp (firstJoint_sub used) with h|h
  · exact cells h
  · exact kernel h

