  simp only [List.mem_toFinset, List.mem_cons] at hq
  rcases hq with rfl|hq
  · exact Or.inl rfl
  · exact hm q hq

                                                                                              
                                                    
                                                                  
            
                                             
                                                    
                       
                    
                 

