/-!
# Structural support lifting for staircase loans

The large lifetime half is never reduced to its instruction list in this
module.  The generic lemmas below isolate the support and physicality effects
of `emitLoan`; concrete arithmetic components can then be composed without a
kernel evaluation of the complete half.
-/

set_option autoImplicit false
set_option maxRecDepth 30000
set_option maxHeartbeats 12000000
set_option linter.unusedSimpArgs false
set_option linter.unnecessarySimpa false

namespace ECDSAAdd.Entrant.StairLoanSupport

open Arithmetic Challenge MappedCompressed Secp256k1 BalancedField
